- [Test an API key](https://docs.apollo.io/docs/test-api-key.md): Call GET https://api.apollo.io/api/v1/auth/health to confirm a key works.
- [Authentication](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/authentication.md): API keys for Apollo users, OAuth 2.0 for partners, and which user each request acts as.
