## Apollo API endpoints

Paths are relative to https://api.apollo.io/api/v1. Each link goes to the reference page for the first endpoint named.

- [People API Search](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/people-api-search.md): POST /mixed_people/api_search finds net-new people in Apollo's database with filters. It returns no emails or phone numbers and consumes no credits.
- [People Enrichment](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/people-enrichment.md): POST /people/match enriches one person and can reveal emails and phone numbers or run waterfall enrichment. Consumes credits.
- [Bulk People Enrichment](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/bulk-people-enrichment.md): POST /people/bulk_match enriches up to 10 people per request. Consumes credits.
- [Get Complete Person Info](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/get-complete-person-info.md): GET /people/{id} returns full details for a person, including employment history. 1 credit per person.
- [Organization Search](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/organization-search.md): POST /mixed_companies/search finds companies with filters. 1 credit per page of up to 100 results.
- [Organization Enrichment](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/organization-enrichment.md): GET /organizations/enrich enriches one company identified by its domain, LinkedIn URL, website, or name. 1 credit per organization.
- [Bulk Organization Enrichment](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/bulk-organization-enrichment.md): POST /organizations/bulk_enrich enriches up to 10 companies per request. 1 credit per organization.
- [Get Complete Organization Info](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/get-complete-organization-info.md): GET /organizations/{id} returns full details for an organization. 1 credit per company.
- [Organization Job Postings](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/organization-jobs-postings.md): GET /organizations/{organization_id}/job_postings returns a company's current job postings. 1 credit per page.
- [News Articles Search](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/news-articles-search.md): POST /news_articles/search finds news articles about specific companies. 1 credit per page of up to 25 results.
- [Contacts](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/search-for-contacts.md): POST /contacts/search searches the people saved to your team's Apollo account and POST /contacts creates a contact; the docs also cover viewing, updating, bulk changes, stages, and owners.
- [Accounts](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/search-for-accounts.md): POST /accounts/search searches saved companies and POST /accounts creates an account; the docs also cover updates, bulk changes, stages, and owners.
- [Deals](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/list-all-deals.md): GET /opportunities/search lists deals and POST /opportunities creates one; the docs also cover viewing, updating, and deal stages.
- [Lists](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/get-a-list-of-all-lists.md): GET /labels returns every list, and POST /labels/add_entity_ids_to_label_names adds contacts or accounts to lists by name.
- [Notes](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/get-a-list-of-notes.md): GET /notes returns the notes on a contact, account, deal, calendar event, or conversation.
- [Sequences](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/search-for-sequences.md): POST /emailer_campaigns/search finds sequences, POST /sequences creates one, and POST /emailer_campaigns/{sequence_id}/add_contact_ids adds contacts to it.
- [Email schedules](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/list-email-schedules.md): GET /emailer_schedules returns your team's sending schedules, time zones, and weekly sending windows.
- [Emails](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/search-for-outreach-emails.md): GET /emailer_messages/search finds sequence emails, POST /emailer_messages creates a draft, and POST /emailer_messages/{id}/send_now sends it.
- [Calls](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/search-for-calls.md): GET /phone_calls/search finds dialer calls, and POST /phone_calls logs calls made in other systems. Both require a master API key.
- [Tasks](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/search-tasks.md): POST /tasks/search finds tasks and POST /tasks creates one; the docs also cover bulk create, update, complete, and skip.
- [Conversations](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/search-conversations.md): POST /conversations/search finds recorded conversations, and POST /conversations/export exports them as a gzipped JSON file.
- [Run an Assistant task](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/run-an-assistant-task.md): POST /agents/task creates, polls, and continues an Apollo AI Assistant task. Credits vary with the actions the Assistant takes.
- [Users and email accounts](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/get-current-user-profile.md): GET /users/api_profile returns the profile behind your credentials, GET /users/search lists users, and GET /email_accounts lists linked inboxes.
- [Fields](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/get-a-list-of-fields.md): GET /fields lists fields, and POST /fields creates custom contact, account, or deal fields.
- [Query analytics report](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/sync-report.md): POST /reports/sync_report queries aggregated sales activity data. Limited to 5 requests per hour.
- [Usage stats](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/view-api-usage-stats.md): POST /usage_stats/api_usage_stats shows API usage and rate limits, and POST /usage_stats/credit_usage_stats shows credit balances.
- [Poll webhook result](https://docs.apollo.io/reference/poll-webhook-result.md): GET /webhook_result/{request_id} retrieves results whose webhook callback you did not receive.

