## Apollo MCP and CLI

- [Apollo MCP docs](https://docs.apollo.io/docs/apollo-mcp.md): Connect Apollo to an AI tool through the remote MCP server at https://mcp.apollo.io/mcp (Streamable HTTP, OAuth 2.0). Built-in connectors cover ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Replit, and Cursor, and any MCP client that supports remote servers can connect; in Claude Code, run `claude mcp add --transport http apollo https://mcp.apollo.io/mcp`, then `/mcp` to sign in. Connecting is free; your plan, permissions, and credits still apply.
- [Apollo CLI](https://docs.apollo.io/docs/apollo-cli-overview.md): Shell-native access to the full Apollo API. Install with `brew install apolloio/apollo-io-cli/apollo-io-cli` and sign in with `apollo auth login`, which uses OAuth instead of an API key.
